8
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:55,540
Your system isn't designed to maximize cures. It's designed to maximize grant-writing.

9
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:03,100
This isn't a conspiracy. It's just what happens when you design a system that rewards asking for money instead of producing

10
