22
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:55,520
Defense contractors, generals, politicians, and workers all have concentrated interests in military spending.

23
00:06:55,520 --> 00:07:02,940
They coordinate. They lobby. They win budgets. Result: the most powerful military in human history.

24
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:03,240
Disease has no such coalition. Your patients are too sick to lobby.

25
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:06,720
Your researchers compete for scraps. Your funders lack coordination.

26
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:12,720
Your politicians get no credit for cures that arrive after their term ends (which is all of them, because cures take fifteen

27
